Vendored from that repository (commit recorded in VENDORED_SHA.txt):

- frontend UI, adapted in src/ for on-device use
- common/ as third_party/nerolis-lab/common (sleepapi-common)
- the production simulation from backend/src as
  third_party/nerolis-lab/engine (database, HTTP routes, controllers,
  and workers omitted)
- public sprites, fonts, and PWA icons

The only architectural change is that team and IV simulation run in the
browser, and user saves live in IndexedDB. There is no long-lived
backend and no Google, Discord, or Patreon login for user data.

Chakra Petch is SIL Open Font License 1.1. The font files ship in
public/fonts/ as part of the Lab frontend public directory.
